lar/hoven padawan/en la 2 con mucha marcha y ᐉTPH,  en la 3 Megatrix o el Club Disney en Tele5/cuando Tele5 molaba y ponyta Pokémon el sábado/No infantiles ni dibus, puro adultos/Los Simpsons/T5","image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNTU2OWE0YWYtMjRlMS00NTUwLWJmZWUtODFhNzJiMGJlMzI3XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_SX300.jpg","info":"","stations":[{"name":"05x01. El cuarteto vocal de Homer","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/d7659fc2612be395e53467f4aa22cbd9?fid=4398713428586-250528-53338455074242&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-mbcrnApnrR47NedljFiTP2893P0%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=359977546203976559&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785717691&r=450577952&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"05x02. El cabo del miedo","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/ff323130b87181fbc1f5625bad202242?fid=4398713428586-250528-29447342259158&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-Sh3uf9k9X3cI4%2bvBFjbu%2fmZNBFc%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=359977546203976559&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785717691&r=970658730&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"05x03. Homer asiste a la universidad","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/2a805736946adaa01092fcee88a2d233?fid=4398713428586-250528-639470490745390&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-uT32%2fjaWDdK8uiCPk8lypmH2wKQ%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=359977546203976559&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785717691&r=648729914&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"05x04. Ciudadano Burns","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/48c249b3ca4d9b0421f4bac122d36297?fid=4398713428586-250528-697353115346236&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-Lq9VVgrmWWWDdYgd5%2f7xffxHEgo%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=359977546203976559&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785717691&r=652704970&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"05x05. La casa-arbol del terror IV","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/da85dd6a95752ea7a9fe11c27a257ddf?fid=4398713428586-250528-972536193344276&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-5P6j%2bjINh